  "contract_review": {
    "authority": "Preliminary getUser never substitutes SQL current SID/workspace/listing/current source authorizers. Preparation + final save repeat current authority after waits/IO. Grant requires current actor/session/scope/hash and bounded30minute expiry. Teammate currently authorized can reverify already registered asset bytes after original uploader SID disappears.",
    "canonical": "Original/output use unchanged canonical asset_save; final private campaign uses unchanged social_save_post with emptychannels/nullschedule/draft. Recipe lives solely in canonical social_posts.meta.creative_composition. Existing request/receipt writer remains; private append-only sidecar only grant/proof/deleted security events. No new editable store or provider.",
    "bytes": "Fixed Storage-origin only, redirect:error,5MiB/body/parser/SHA/MIME/dims/objecttuple exact. Actual POST409+reread, changed object tuple, tampered bytes/same namespace/wrong MIME/oversize/revokedauthority afterGET refuse. No external source URL accepted/fetched by Edge. Does not claim server rerender or pixel-to-recipe/visual/rights certification.",
    "recovery": "Lost final save response returns same canonical receipt and object/asset/post IDs after reload without localfiles. Render requests never fall back to generic/source-only writer. Missing localfile remains pending with exact original request; cancellednonce cannot be recreated. Cleanup failure503 stays explicit and recoverable.",
    "cancellation_locking": "Real two-backend oldcancel\u2192grant and grant\u2192oldcancel, cleanup\u2192save and save\u2192cleanup, object-first deletion versus final consume all pass. Existing receipt BEFOREINSERT guard binds actor/scope/hash and uses same nonce lock. RLS does nonblocking nonce check while Storage holds row; no reverse blocking wait.",
    "cleanup": "Durable canonical cancellation tombstone precedes exact new unattached paths deletion. Saved/canonical assets and existing source originals are retained. Service-only proof/cleanup ACLs, private table no directuser/service access. Bounded20expiredrequests maintenance path exists but no scheduler activation is claimed.",
    "legacy": "Exactlytwo restrictive reserved namespace Storage INSERT/DELETE policies leave legacy paths/permissive policies unchanged. Existing source-only old receipts remain usable; unrelated first-Studio requests unaffected. First13prerequisite and14dependencies owner freeze remain historical unchanged; raster modifies only two permitted frontend prerequisites. Owner additionally reported firstStudio21PG/12mounted+AI24/editorial23 regression; these are owner evidence, not a separate reviewer rerun.",
    "ui_races": "Held removed-asset byte response cannot become original after refresh; late library result cannot replace newer explicit localfile. Actor/SID/workspace changes scrub retained input/canvas/blob refs. Crop/resize/contain/contrast/textfit errors,permission/alt requirement,modalEscape focus/body-scroll restore verified."
  },
